WEBVTT

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:03.479
Bringing that authentic
context to learning

00:08:03.521 --> 00:08:08.317
helps students retain knowledge
and generate new ideas.

00:08:10.903 --> 00:08:15.866
After weeks and weeks
of working on their projects

00:08:15.866 --> 00:08:20.496
and giving each other authentic,
supportive feedback,

00:08:20.496 --> 00:08:23.207
and doing that fine-tuning,

00:08:23.249 --> 00:08:26.585
the students are ready for the big day --

00:08:26.627 --> 00:08:28.420
the exhibition of learning.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:32.591
This is where hundreds of people
from the community,